Description: Call-graph chain explorer for *_cg.json call graphs
 chainscope loads per-artifact, source-level static call graphs (*_cg.json),
 lets you pick a source and a sink function, and finds every call chain between
 them. Chains can be stitched across several graphs through stub-to-definition
 bridges, so a route from an application into its dependencies shows up end to
 end. Subcommands cover reachability verdicts, chokepoints, dependency surfaces,
 graph diffs and a JSON-spec CI gate.
 .
 This package ships a fully static build with the GUI compiled out, so it has
 no dependencies and suits servers, containers, CI gates and minimal images.
 For the desktop application install chainscope-gui instead: the two provide the
 same /usr/bin/chainscope and cannot be installed together.

